# Deprecations the unit suite is allowed to trigger (phpunit-bridge ignoreFile,
# see phpunit.xml.dist). One regex per line.
#
# The bundle SHIPS deprecated makers (make:auth, make:unit-test,
# make:functional-test, make:subscriber). Any test that exercises the full
# maker locator loads those classes, which triggers their own file-level
# deprecations — that is the deprecated code working as designed, not a
# regression. Everything else under max[self]=0 still fails the build.
%^Since symfony/maker-bundle [^:]+: The "Symfony\\Bundle\\MakerBundle\\Maker\\[^"]+" class is deprecated%
%^Since symfony/maker-bundle [^:]+: The "maker\.maker\.make_[a-z_]+" service is deprecated%
